{"product":{"id":8778530029804,"title":"Cortech Meal Tray Drying Rack","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eCortech highly durable, aluminum meal tray drying racks are offered in various sizes to facilitate the needs of any kitchen.  The racks are designed with custom inserts that separate individual pans or trays, allowing air to circulate freely for more efficient drying and storage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFramework constructed of 1\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"\u003e½\u003c\/span\u003e″ x 1\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"\u003e¾\u003c\/span\u003e″ aluminum wall tubing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAngle tray guides are .09″ thick and are spaced on 1\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"\u003e½\u003c\/span\u003e″ and 2\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"\u003e¾\u003c\/span\u003e″ centers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6″ x 2″ platform-type swivel casters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThree and four shelf units available. All-welded and fabricated to accommodate required tray or pan capacities\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAll Guides .09\" Thick and Radius for Safety\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLifetime Guarantee against rust and corrosion\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShips knocked down to save shipping costs. Some assembly required\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u0